#!args --verify-dirty
# the wheel of a diagram (ui/diagram.rs) from a touchpad: Ctrl + the fine steps of a precision
# touchpad zoom a step per 120 (each step zoomed a whole one); a trackpad's pixels pan by those
# pixels; with the system's five lines a notch pans 80 DIP
theme light
expect text:"Zoom: 100 %" exists
expect text:"Mitte: 496,296" exists
wheel 550,388 40 ctrl fine
expect text:"Zoom: 100 %" exists
wheel 550,388 40 ctrl fine
wheel 550,388 40 ctrl fine
expect text:"Zoom: 125 %" exists
wheel 550,388 -60 ctrl fine
wheel 550,388 -60 ctrl fine
expect text:"Zoom: 100 %" exists
# a trackpad: down by 10 DIP, right by 4
wheel 550,388 -10 4 pixels
expect text:"Mitte: 500,306" exists
click "Einpassen"
expect text:"Mitte: 496,296" exists
# five lines a notch: 80 DIP
system env jfgui_WHEEL_LINES 5
system settings other
wheel 550,388 -120
expect text:"Mitte: 496,376" exists
system env jfgui_WHEEL_LINES -
system settings other
